    "description": "E2E test collection for audio memory routes (src/routes/memory_routes.py). Covers upload, list, get (signed URL), delete, ownership/authorization checks, and path-traversal protection. Uploads use a small local dummy .mp3 fixture (Backend/postman/fixtures/test_audio.mp3) - not real user audio."
